{"articleNo":"82130","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=82130&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013 대만연구 외국인 학자 초빙 프로그램 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.04.24","hit":"3179","attachments":[{"name":"1.대만학 연구보조금 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82130&attachNo=71511"},{"name":"2.대만한 연구보조금_원문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82130&attachNo=71830"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대만 대표부에서는 2013 대만학 연구를 위한 외국인 학자 모집을 하는 바, 귀기관에서 관심있는 지원자들의 신청바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2013 대만연구 외국인 학자 초빙 프로그램</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 초청기관 : 대만 한학연구센터(The Center for chinese studies) 및 대만 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;외교부</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 대상 : 대만에서 대만학과 중국학을 연구하는 데 관심이 있는 대 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학 교수 혹은, 박사과정 지원생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 지원 내역</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;가. 왕복 항공권</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. 월간 보조금액 : 웹 사이트 참조</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교수 : NT$ 60,000</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 협력교수 : NT$ 50,000</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;다. 보험</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;4. 보조금 지원 기간 : &nbsp;3개월 ~ 1년</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;5. 지원 서류</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 지원서: 웹 사이트 참조</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이력서(발표, 출간물 포함)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 연구계획(분량 제한 없음)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 추천서(최소 1명 이상, 사인 필)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 지원 마감 일 : 2013. 05. 31. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 기타 사항 : 프로그램에 대한 문의는 아래 문의처로 직접 하시기 바람.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"83\" valign=\"center\" width=\"276\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;문의처</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☏ 886-2-2314-7321</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 10.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임 : 1.대만학 연구보조금 안내 1부</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임 : 2. 대만학 연구보조금-원문 1부. 끝.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\